<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Cadastro Pendente - Kakau Tech</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/public/favicon.webp" />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1b2a 0%, #152238 40%, #0c5e84 100%);
        color: #495057;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 520px;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 48px 40px;
        background-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        animation: slideUp 0.5s ease;
      }
      @keyframes slideUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
        to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
      .icon {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        background: #e8f5fd;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
      }
      .icon svg { width: 32px; height: 32px; color: #1187bd; }
      h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1187bd; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .lead {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #495057;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .info-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 32px 0;
        text-align: left;
        border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .info-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #495057;
        line-height: 1.5;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
      }
      .info-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .info-list li svg { flex-shrink: 0; width: 18px; height: 18px; color: #1187bd; margin-top: 2px; }
      .contact-block {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #868e96;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .contact-block a { color: #1187bd; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
      .contact-block a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .btn-back {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1187BD;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background 0.2s;
      }
      .btn-back:hover { background: #0e6a94; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"
            d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1>Cadastro Recebido!</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Sua solicitação foi enviada com sucesso. Nossa equipe irá revisar seus dados
        e ativar sua conta em breve.
      </p>

      <ul class="info-list">
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          <span>Você receberá um <strong>e-mail de confirmação</strong> assim que sua conta for aprovada.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <span>Em geral, aprovamos novas contas em até <strong>1 dia útil</strong>.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <span>Nenhuma ação é necessária da sua parte agora. Fique de olho no e-mail cadastrado.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="contact-block">
        Precisa de aprovação com urgência? Entre em contato pelo e-mail
        <a href="mailto:suporte@kakautech.com">suporte@kakautech.com</a>
      </p>

      <a href="/portal/login" class="btn-back">Voltar para o Login</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
